{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeTheme","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangetheme"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Inherits From","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/OUDSTheme"],"type":"inheritsFrom","kind":"relationships"},{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/SQ","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:16OUDSThemesOrange0B5ThemeC","title":"OrangeTheme","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Class","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeTheme"}],"modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeTheme","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"class"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeTheme","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":1,"type":"heading","text":"Usages","anchor":"Usages"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Any Orange products must use this theme. It provides core and Orange colors and any elements for sizings, spacings and dimensions for example."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The system font families are used; no "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helevetica"}]},{"type":"text","text":" font family is embeded nor providd  by OUDS."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This theme also provides colors charts tokens."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The theme can be got through environment variable:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    @Environment(\\.theme) var theme"],"syntax":"swift"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Integration","anchor":"Integration"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To use this theme, inject it to your view using ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and get it through environment variable.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    @main","    struct YourApp: App {","        var body: some Scene {","            WindowGroup {","                OUDSThemeableView(theme: OrangeTheme()) {","                    \/\/ Your root view","                }","            }","        }","    }"],"syntax":"swift"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Theme tuning","anchor":"Theme-tuning"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The theme can be customized a bit for more flexibility thanks to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Tuning"},{"type":"text","text":" object."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You just need to give a predefined tuning configuration at theme init to build the one you need."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To apply the tuning:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Define your theme tuning","    let tuning = Tuning(hasRoundedButtons: true,","                        hasRoundedTextInputs: true,","                        hasRoundedAlertMessages: true,","                        hasRoundedProgressIndicators: true,","                        hasRoundedListItems: true)","","    \/\/ Apply it to your theme","    let theme = OrangeTheme(tuning: tuning)","","    \/\/ Or apply predefined tunings","    let orangeFranceTheme = OrangeTheme(tuning: Tuning.OrangeFrance)","    let orangeBusinessTheme = OrangeTheme(tuning: Tuning.OrangeBusiness)","    let maxitTheme = OrangeTheme(tuning: Tuning.MaxIt)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Typography","anchor":"Typography"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Helvetica Neue","anchor":"Helvetica-Neue"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The Orange brand strongly relies on the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helvetica Neue"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" font family. Thus each Orange brand should, or must, use it.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For iOS the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helvetica Neue"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" font family is available at system level, so it is not needed to get it through external assets.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"By default an instance of ","type":"text"},{"code":"OrangeTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" uses as font family the token ","type":"text"},{"code":"OrangeBrandFontRawTokens.familyBrandDefault","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which is today ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helvetica Neue"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If you want to use another font family, you will have to send the suitable token or the suitable font family.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However, beware, iOS API relies also on the PostScript name of the font.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To be sure of the value to use, look at the font book of your device.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It is recommended to use the font raw tokens.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ The following instanciations work","    let orangeTheme = OrangeTheme()","    let orangeTheme = OrangeTheme(fontFamily: OrangeBrandFontRawTokens.familyBrandDefault)","    let orangeTheme = OrangeTheme(fontFamily: \"HelveticaNeue\") \/\/ Which is PostScript name of the font","    let orangeTheme = OrangeTheme(fontFamily: \"Helvetica Neue\") \/\/ Which is font family nale"]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Helvetica Neue Arabic","anchor":"Helvetica-Neue-Arabic"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Helvetica Neue","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" font family does not manage arabic alphabet but latin one, it is possible apply another font family to the theme like the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Helvetica Neue Arabic","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":". This font family assets can be retrieved through the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/brand.orange.com\/en\/brand-basics\/typography","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"PostScript name management has been implemented for this font family, thus the weight are managed and it is only needed to add the font assets to the project,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"register them and define the font family name to use."}]},{"code":["    let orangeTheme = OrangeTheme(family: \"Helvetica Neue Arabic\")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Tokens-loading","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Tokens loading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can also use some tokens providers defined in your side, but they must match the same type as the one used on the themes (see "},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For example:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["   \/\/ Use some already defined providers","   let borders = OrangeThemeBorderSemanticTokensProvider()","   let sizes = OrangeThemeSizeSemanticTokensProvider()","   let spaces = OrangeThemeSpaceSemanticTokensProvider()","","   \/\/ For example, use your own provider of color semantic tokens","   \/\/ It must inherit from OrangeThemeBorderSemanticTokensProvider (which is instance of AllColorSemanticTokensProvider) or directly implement AllColorSemanticTokensProvider","   let colors = YourOwnColorSemanticTokensProvider()","","   \/\/ Some providers need other providers to use their tokens","   let button = OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider(sizes: sizes, borders: borders, colors: colors, spaces: spaces)","","   \/\/ But you can also use the providers as they are without assigning semantic tokens providers","   \/\/ and just use the default ones","   let badge = OrangeThemeBadgeComponentTokensProvider()","","   \/\/ Define in the end your theme by overriding some providers.","   \/\/ You can override all providers, or only some, or just keep the theme as is.","   \/\/ However you should uses thhese providers in a dedicated Orange theme subclass for clarity reasons.","   let yourOwnOrangeTheme = OrangeTheme(colors: colors, borders: borders, sizes: sizes, spaces: spaces, button: button, badge: badge)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Tokens-versions","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Tokens versions"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Core OUDS version: 1.10.0","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Core Orange version: 1.2.0","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Brand Orange version: 2.5.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0.8.0"}]}],"name":"Since"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange"]]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The Orange theme is the bsic, default, theme for any Orange products.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is an override of the abtract ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"must be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It can overrid